ef 17592186498787 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499319 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186498942 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499319 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186499292 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499319 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499319 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499319 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186498760 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499319 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "0f7da737-6ab6-5dc3-a356-5e38af59041a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499427 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186498822 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499427 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186499059 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499427 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186499097 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499427 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186499207 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499427 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186499253 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499427 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499427 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499427 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186498822 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499427 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "f38fea1a-0a62-5cc4-9aaa-d50dbb5879df" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499428 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186498857 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499428 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186499006 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499428 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186499065 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499428 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186499135 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499428 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186499172 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499428 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499428 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499428 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186499172 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499428 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "f7015fd4-ab37-5009-8ea6-02df343db6e5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499527 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186499427 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499527 #edb/ref 1069 "q-72439" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499527 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499527 #edb/ref 1071 "At which points on the curve ${y}^{2}-xy=x+1$ is the tangent vector to the curve perpendicular to the vector $i?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499527 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "b5a12ff0-24e0-5963-9f16-1e9a01270fba" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499527 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we bring all variables to one side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{2}-xy & =x+1 \\\\ {y}^{2}-xy-x & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we set $f(x,y)={y}^{2}-xy-x$, our curve can be viewed as the level curve $f(x,y)=1.$ \n\nA tangent vector to the level curve can be computed as follows:\n\n$$\nt(x,y)={f}_{y}(x,y)\\,i-{f}_{x}(x,y)\\,j\n$$\n\nSo, we calculate $t(x,y):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}t(x,y) & ={f}_{y}(x,y)\\,i-{f}_{x}(x,y)\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({y}^{2}-xy-x)i-\\frac{∂}{∂x}({y}^{2}-xy-x)j \\\\  & =(2y-x)\\,i+(y+1)\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince our tangent vector needs to be perpendicular to $i$, we must have $t\\cdot i=0.$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}t(x,y)\\cdot i & =0 \\\\ ((2y-x)\\,i+(y+1)\\,j)\\cdot i & =0 \\\\ 2y-x & =0 \\\\ x & =2y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=2y$ into the equation of our curve gives:  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{2}-(2y)y-(2y) & =1 \\\\ {y}^{2}-2{y}^{2}-2y-1 & =0 \\\\ -{y}^{2}-2y-1 & =0 \\\\ {y}^{2}+2y+1 & =0 \\\\ (y+1)^{2} & =0 \\\\ y & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally:\n\n- If $y=-1$, we get $x=-2$ and the corresponding point is $(-2,-1).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499529 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186499428 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499529 #edb/ref 1069 "q-65205" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499529 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499529 #edb/ref 1071 "Consider the plane curve $x{e}^{y}-1=xy.$ Find a tangent vector to that curve at the point $(1,0).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499529 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "b96af04a-99a9-59d6-b4b4-fac54542ff08" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499529 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we bring all variables to one side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x{e}^{y}-1 & =xy \\\\ x{e}^{y}-xy & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we set $f(x,y)=x{e}^{y}-xy$, our curve can be viewed as the level curve $f(x,y)=1.$ \n\nA tangent vector to the level curve that passes through the point $(1,0)$ can be computed as follows:\n\n$$\nt(1,0)={f}_{y}(1,0)i-{f}_{x}(1,0)j\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, we calculate $t(x,y)$ and evaluate it at $(1,0):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}t(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x{e}^{y}-xy)i-\\frac{∂}{∂x}(x{e}^{y}-xy)j \\\\  & =(x{e}^{y}-x)i-({e}^{y}-y)j \\\\ t(1,0) & =((1){e}^{0}-(1))i-({e}^{0}-(0))j \\\\  & =-j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our tangent vector is $-j.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499554 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186499319 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499554 #edb/ref 1069 "q-72389" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499554 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499554 #edb/ref 1071 "Consider the plane curve $2{e}^{xy}=x+y+1.$ Find a tangent vector to that curve at the point $(0,1).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499554 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "ea587ab0-d077-5468-b262-1697c88c7094" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499554 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we bring all variables to one side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{e}^{xy} & =x+y+1 \\\\ 2{e}^{xy}-x-y-1 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we set $f(x,y)=2{e}^{xy}-x-y-1$, our curve can be viewed as the level curve $f(x,y)=0.$ \n\nA tangent vector to the level curve that passes through the point $(0,1)$ can be computed as follows:\n\n$$\nt(0,1)={f}_{y}(0,1)\\,i-{f}_{x}(0,1)\\,j\n$$\n\nSo, we calculate $t(x,y)$ and evaluate it at $(0,1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}t(x,y) & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2{e}^{xy}-x-y-1)\\,i-\\frac{∂}{∂x}(2{e}^{xy}-x-y-1)\\,j \\\\  & =(2x{e}^{xy}-1)\\,i-(2y{e}^{xy}-1)\\,j \\\\ t(0,1) & =(2(0){e}^{(0)(1)}-1)\\,i-(2(1){e}^{(0)(1)}-1)\\,j \\\\  & =-i-j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our tangent vector is $-i-j.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499569 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186499600 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499569 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "05a2099a-d88b-5b18-b5ca-d033c5db5614" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499569 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186124970 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499577 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186499584 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499577 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "2f4293a9-a10e-5b28-82a5-1a8b2fd293b4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499577 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186499527 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499584 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "4cfb1824-7d95-5b0c-8d42-9c86792c679d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499584 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186363031 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499600 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186499624 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499600 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "8b2ff19d-a282-5f52-b7ed-a3b65431ddba" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499600 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186499529 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499624 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186499577 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499624 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "dcad53eb-6ded-5184-a27b-881f5dbfc54b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499624 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186499554 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
